<PlainPage
	title="Editorial Policy: How We Test and Review"
	heading="Editorial policy"
	eyebrow="Trust"
	description="How Swagamerz prepares gaming guides, identifies updates and discloses sponsored content."
	path="/editorial-policy/"
	updated="1 Oct 2026"
>
	<h2>Guide information</h2>
	<p>
		Game settings and features can vary by platform, hardware and game version. Check the current in-game options and official patch notes before applying a guide.
	</p>
	<h2>Reviews</h2>
	<p>
		Reviews represent the author's opinion and should clearly identify the game and platform discussed. Sponsored coverage must be labelled.
	</p>
	<h2>Keeping guides current</h2>
	<p>
		When a material change is made to a guide, its updated date should be changed and the change explained where useful.
	</p>
	<h2>Sponsored content and links</h2>
	<p>
		Sponsored posts and affiliate links will be clearly labelled. Any advertising or affiliate relationship does not represent an endorsement by a game publisher.
	</p>
	<h2>Corrections</h2>
	<p>Corrections can be requested through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</PlainPage>
